reference.api:
```
GET /v1/feed?session=&cursor=&limit=20  → {posts[], next_cursor, session}
POST /v1/feed/events  {post_id, type: impression|click|hide|dwell, ms}
```
- `session` pins a ranked ordering for a few minutes so pagination never repeats or reshuffles items; `cursor` is an offset into that snapshot.
- Impressions and dwell time are the training signal, so the event endpoint is high-volume and asynchronous.
